{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-11_beg","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-11","title":"冰原之雪","storyCode":"6-12","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-11_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ba0c334e5f81b7a1bb7c7e0f149b374336f1a8d6f33446b8b60457152ff4cf3e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我確認過了，所有能聯繫上的整合運動隊伍已經全部撤出了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"人真多啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"浩浩蕩蕩的......就像河水一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"荒原上會出現一條河流......一條逃難者的河流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"既有烏薩斯人，也有龍門人。既有感染者，也有普通人。來時他們或貧或富，去時他們兩手空空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"原本他們認定有一個地方可以接受自己，現在他們知道自己總歸無處可去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這條河流，最終會從這荒原上消逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的語氣好悲傷。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（從大爹那學的吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"（也難怪。這個時候了，人難免有些感傷的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大爹在這，我們一定打得贏，也不用走到這個地步吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"運氣好壞這種事，你再怎麼考慮另一種結局都沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......準備一下。我去和幻影弩手們商量下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"別催我呀，我又不是不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊去，別拖拖拉拉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我也挺感傷的啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"確定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是雪怪小隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭他們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"已經趕赴現場了。阿米婭要我囑託你，“別衝動”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"這話和沒說一樣。她知道的......要說衝動，我在羅德島算得上是第一名了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"煌！你去哪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"去救人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"弩手們！請稍等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪......等等，你這是做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......霜星大姊她的身體，已經支撐不了多久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛剛為了擊退龍門的部隊，已經耗盡了氣力。可能一時半會還醒不過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是要我們再帶上她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們本不準備回切爾諾伯格。浮士德也不希望梅菲斯特......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們懇求你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都希望大姊最後，最後能和愛國者一起度過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然他們的關係現在有點不好，但我們知道的......他們之間的親情比血還濃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......懇求你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"你們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們給你們殿後。如果不給你們拖一段時間，你們很快就會被龍門追上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"等你們和其他人走遠了，對龍門沒有威脅了，他們也不好再追緝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可那樣的話，你們就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"只要戰鬥，就總會戰死的。戰死在這裡，我們都覺得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"霜星大姊她說的未來，有一點遠。但我們其實也不必親眼看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"又欠了你們一條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也幫我們帶上了大姊。這不算什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們一定完成你們的託付。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這個，護臂和防護裝，你穿上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊的溫度會冷到你受不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......她好輕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"法術掏空了她的身體。輕點，再輕點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"別弄醒她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你看她......看她睡得多熟啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"再見了，大姊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會等你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......先走一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是我們先走一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"總會再見面的，雪怪們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"希望這一天來得遲些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要死了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"*烏薩斯粗口*，你怎麼就流眼淚了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你這樣也算雪怪嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也在哭？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我哭什麼了我！......你忘了大姐怎麼說的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她說別哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"對！她說別哭......十多年前，她說別哭！別掉眼淚！我們不配......因為我們還沒打贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"等我們贏了，等我們自由了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們自由了，我們會放聲大哭，在荒野裡在雪地裡，在堆得滿滿的麥垛裡放聲大哭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"明明大姊也一邊說一邊哭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那時她才九歲啊。我們都比她要大好幾歲啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有大姊，我們已經死在那座礦場了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"你帶了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"帶什麼......等等，不是不准帶嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"是不准行軍的時候喝。但你帶身上的，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想喝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，你年齡沒到啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可我以前沒有喝過啊，我不想味道都沒嘗過就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"給他一點吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"佩特洛娃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊。喝一點吧。可別喝太多，其他人也要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟們，都喝一點吧，暖暖身子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"敬大姊和大老爹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊全體","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敬霜星和愛國者！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你認識這些感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，陳長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但這最後一場戰鬥必須現在打響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有得選嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們可能別無選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看你的身後。現在的他們甚至沒有刻意隱藏自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......黑色雨披。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們必須要和他們戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們必須要做的。不這麼做，我們就會落下把柄，把特殊部隊強行拉來壓制雪怪小隊的行為也會變得毫無說服力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你有沒有可能勸服他們投降？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他們的身後還有感染者......他們就不會投降。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不會逼你們參與戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，陳長官。但是......但是我們會見證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局英勇堅決地戰鬥了，沒人能否認。你們在為了龍門而戰，你們抗擊了侵略者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們幫助你們對抗那些特殊部隊的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"而對於我們自己來說......我們要記下每一場感染者的戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"每一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰鬥結束以後，我們一起去吃個飯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"可，可我是感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不用在意。那個聲音很大的，個子很高的，這兩個人也不會在意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這場戰鬥......無論是誰都損失太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對於我們來說是戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對於龍門來說，這確確實實是一場戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是那個策劃了這一切的人，並不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我有必須要告知你們的事情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——但不是現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，不是現在，陳警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不想看嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我......."},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但就像在切城廢城時那樣......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"對。我已經下定決心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須要......親眼去看。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們一起。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"原來叫大姊......不是因為年齡才這麼叫？我為什麼現在才知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"得了，你必須這麼叫。那年你才三歲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，態度這麼差，沒兩口就醉了？你喊餓的時候，我是少分你麵包了還是沒把湯分給你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這個是這個，那個是......那個！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"說來，有些好笑。我突然在想羅德島那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"想他們幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"那個渾身冒熱氣的貓，說要和我們一起喝點那隻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"有些遺憾。她看上去量不錯，胡鬧起來也一定很帶勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"但那隻小兔子，怎麼也沒到這個歲數吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"她多大？十六？十七？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"也就十四左右吧。只是逼著自己說些大人會說的話而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"和大姊那時候......一樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"這最後一點就敬他們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"祝他們說到做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大熊","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"說到做到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員D","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃......說到做到！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門人理應比他們還要齊心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，別看了。雪怪也只能拖一時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不覺得他們的行為很可貴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們沒命了，那他們豈不是白幹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"按幻影弩手的說法，切爾諾伯格我們確實是回不去了。我們要往新的據點去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你不關心新據點是哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是哪裡，我會和你們一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。你們龍門人，和我們也沒區別啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"本來還想他們會待你們好一點呢，沒想到和烏薩斯差不多一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者在哪都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛來的時候可不是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"九","speakerId":"avg_npc_043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人是會變的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是雪怪嗎？那些是雪怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"是雪怪！是......是雪怪沒錯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪......雪怪！這群雪怪怎麼這麼倔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，可惡！別死！別送死啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"等我過來，我能救你們，我帶你們走......帶你們走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼像你們這樣的感染者也要死在這裡？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊部隊停止進攻了？不，他們好像撤退了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎......是把主動權交給我們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"這是要凸顯下龍門的執法力量？*龍門粗口*，還真是被徹底看低了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，最後一波進攻了。別辜負市民和陳sir的期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們看看吧，讓這些整合運動明白龍門的實力！讓所有感染者都再也不敢冒犯龍門！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"幻影弩手們，可別讓我們失望啊。一定要把大姊送回老爺子身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"......她沒多少時間了。最後的時間裡和老爺子一起過吧，大姊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也沒多少時間了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"安排完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"全部都做好了。讓我們把這條命還了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪怪小隊成員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他們見識一下，由烏薩斯最偉大的戰士博卓卡斯替訓練，由烏薩斯最冷的夢魘帶領的小隊，究竟是什麼樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大姊最後殘留的一點源石技藝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"霜凍源石，準備釋放！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩特洛娃","speakerId":"avg_npc_037","isRemote":false,"text":"大熊！我們上了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"雪怪！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]}]}
